That was awesome!

41
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:53,640
Man Run's added some pages to his grimoire and given his power an upgrade.

42
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,740
Lightning magic! Thunderbolt Destruction!

43
00:03:56,740 --> 00:04:01,080
That team's got a strong offense.

44
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:05,040
Yeah, they're good. And they're only at a junior level, too.

45
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:10,920
Me and Luck have been cranking out the missions like crazy over the past few months, and every one of them has made us that much more powerful.

46
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,620
So obviously being junior rank doesn't mean a damn thing to us.

47
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:20,620
They always did have intermediate level talent, and now I see they've continued to improve.

48
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:23,400
But I've grown as well.

49
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:28,400
Inspired by Asta, I've trained my magic, my muscles, and my mind.

50
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:35,860
And my hard work may betray me, but I won't betray my hard work.

51
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:39,180
Steel magic, fear, spiral, land!

52
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:44,820
Yeah, no, that's the kind of epic beatdown I'm talking about!

53
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:46,700
Wow, Klaus, I'm so proud of you!

54
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,140
I suppose you might be more than a bespectacled worry ward after all!

55
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,040
That was pretty cool!

56
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,840
After the tournament's over, would you want to spar with me?

57
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:58,620
Stop being an incorrigible child and focus on the battle at hand!

58
00:04:58,620 --> 00:05:11,180
That's him. Rob Vitesse. He's turned his back on their crystal.

59
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:16,240
We should attack all three of them head-on and obliterate their crystal in one blow!

60
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,300
You got it!

61
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:21,640
Well, look at that. Turns out you silly boys aren't half bad.

62
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:22,660
Gotcha!

63
